{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-Dwf0kxMXfK9RVsQeUQ8gA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:11.380470+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-Dwf0kxMXfK9RVsQeUQ8gA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>西安外国语大学2027年招收推荐免试硕士研究生（以下简称“推免生”）工作即将开始，有望获得所在本科院校推荐资格且有意申请推荐免试攻读我校我院硕士研究生的人员，可根据此通知进行预申请。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、硕士推免生申请条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德优良，遵纪守法，身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.全国院校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生，学习成绩优秀，研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识和创新能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.符合学院根据学科专业特点制定的其他要求；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.2027年入学前获得本科毕业证书及学位证书。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、招生专业及计划</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>日语语言文学</span></span></p><p><span><span>日语笔译</span></span></p><p><span><span>日语口译</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、申请方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）申请时间：9月7日—9月17日</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）申请方式：申请人登陆下列网址进行申请：https://stuxisu.molstone.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><span>注意事项：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.申请人完成注册后，身份证号即为登录账号；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.登录后点击推免管理－推免生申请填报信息进行相关信息填写；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.申请人需将所有证明材料汇总成一个PDF文件后进行上传。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、复试安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）学院通知复试</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院对推免生的申请信息进行初审，确定复试名单，向申请人发放复试通知。请申请人关注所报学院的官网并保证电话畅通。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）申请人参加复试，学院确定拟录取名单</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人复试时需提供的材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.学生证、身份证原件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.加盖学校教务部门公章的成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.其他有关材料（如专业外语等级证书、大学英语四六级考试成绩单、获奖证书、本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.经本人签字确认的诚信承诺书（附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.学院通知要求的其他材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）推免服务系统</span></span></p><p><span><span>待全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（以下简称“推免服务系统”）开通后，被拟录取的推免生需登录“推免服务系统”进行注册，并按照拟接收的专业填报相关志愿。我校将在“推免服务系统”中发放复试及拟录取通知。未按拟接收专业填报志愿者及未在规定时间内按要求完成录取确认者，均视为自动放弃。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）未进行先期申请的请在“推免服务系统”开通后进行申请。学院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>联系人：崔老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：029-85319794</span></span></p><p><span><span>电子邮箱：riyuxi@xisu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>学校地址：西安外国语大学长安校区（西安郭杜教育科技产业开发区文苑南路1号，616路公交车终点站）。</span></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-Dwf0kxMXfK9RVsQeUQ8gA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：推免诚信承诺书.docx</a></span></p><p><span><span>日本文化经济学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年9月5日</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>END</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>图文 | 崔颖</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 陈涵璐</span></p><p><span>指导老师 | 黄婷</span></p><p><span>一审 | 黄婷</span></p><p><span>二审 | 张琰龙</span></p><p><span>终审 | 葛睿</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><span><span>点击往期精彩，走进</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>本</span></span><span><span>文</span></span><span><span>化</span></span></span></p></section></section><p><span><span><span>关注团</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>组织，聚点</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>系资讯</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxODI5MTM3MQ==&amp;mid=2247622378&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=eb47aa7565bbae860f3820e60dada302&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gv2UVygBG8EM4WwUoXyic8oBMM7C48JliaibfmMG358Qot0eaRqHpFQjuUdL5WC78h51FYHmnQxG9Ve9huhxVG45urxVhEJQ1fro1HsiaIPXrDc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section></section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxODI5MTM3MQ==&amp;mid=2247622548&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=11a8a27ed2f0b927b399a20a46b13dc7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gv2UVygBG8FNgIia3rlRw4jBibVVTibdSK8G0x43LyoZaiaxMF0Z50Xjwia82z7r6aND4HrML0kkx6ySQibM3nBPKWsia9G8zLKQzyKEGLHvqPywO8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section></section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxODI5MTM3MQ==&amp;mid=2247622524&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=3b618ad7f2b7897ee7239aa826f15bca&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gv2UVygBG8EQK7PnfkU6MET4ytrQibVqL6tcJkrT7W8yes6gtK2ndCATtFKHI43SQwR2Iazz